sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as node-cron<br/>"0 22 * * *" (TIMEZONE)
    participant RC as reportController.js<br/>generateDailyReport()
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant M as mailService.js<br/>sendReportEmail()
    participant G as Gmail SMTP

    CR->>RC: Every day at 22:00
    RC->>RC: Target date = yesterday (server clock)<br/>formatted as DD-MM-YYYY
    RC->>DB: User.find() (all users, verified or not)
    loop For each user
        RC->>DB: trackings.find({ userId, eatenDate })
        RC->>DB: userinfos.findOne({ userId })
        RC->>RC: Sum calories, protein, carbs, fat, fiber<br/>percent = calories / dailyCalorieRequirement x 100
        alt user.email present
            RC->>M: sendReportEmail(email, text)
            M->>G: sendMail(...)
            G-->>M: response
        end
        Note over RC: Errors for one user are logged and the loop continues
    end

    Note over CR,G: Manual triggers: POST /admin/send-daily-report (any valid token)<br/>and POST /admin/send-daily-report/:userId (ADMIN_EMAILS only)
